# The review harness writes its host pages next to the bundles.
dist/preview-*.html

# Screenshots and the demo GIF are 5.6 MB and every one of them is dead weight
# inside the package: vsce rewrites the README's relative image paths to
# raw.githubusercontent URLs at packaging time, so the copies the reader sees are
# always the ones on the default branch, never these. Shipping them would triple
# the download for bytes nothing ever loads.
docs/**
